<title>USA: Bank of New York Co Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Bank of New York Co Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.65		    $0.58</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.65		     0.57</p>
<p> Net			265,000		  243,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     405,000		  428,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 revenues from foreign exchange and other trading activities $27 million vs $10 million.</p>
<p>1997 Q1 net charge-offs of credit card loans $93 million vs $96 million.</p>
<p>Q1 allowance for loan losses $869 million, compared to $901 million at December 31.</p>
<p>First Call Q1 estimate was $0.63/shr.</p>
</text>
